# Built dashboard bundle (`make dashboard`). Deliberately not committed: Vite
# content-hashes every asset filename, so any change under web/src renamed the
# whole directory and rewrote index.html, which made rebases and merges conflict
# by construction. The Docker image builds it in a Node stage instead; a source
# checkout that has not built it degrades to the tutorial page.
/src/gateway/static/dashboard/
